<% content_for :meta_title, "Rails, Shopify, and SMB Automation Case Studies | Doug Morgen" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Selected work across SMB automation, Rails apps, Shopify systems, internal tools, accounting migrations, and operations software." %>

<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="rise-in">
        <p class="pill">Selected work</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Projects for businesses with real operational problems.</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">This is the kind of work I am best at: production Rails apps, Shopify-connected operations, accounting migrations, AI-assisted workflows, and the systems that keep a business running.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">If your team is juggling handoffs, disconnected tools, or operations where mistakes are expensive, we should probably talk.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rise-in">
        <%= render "inquiries/quick_form_cta" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block pt-0">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="card">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Rails + AI operations</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Homebrand</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Built homeowner operations software with document ingestion, OCR extraction, retrieval search, cited AI assistance, and maintenance workflows for property records.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Good fit for: internal knowledge systems, document-heavy workflows, AI with citations.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Shopify + commissions</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">ArraFund Commission Platform</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Built a connected Rails app and Shopify app system to track commissions, process campaign-linked orders, and sync webhook-driven data into payout and operations flows.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Good fit for: e-commerce operations, webhook pipelines, custom Shopify workflows.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">ERP + accounting</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">BrightGo ERP Migration</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Led hybrid ERP accounting and operations work, including high-throughput legacy ledger migration, idempotent imports, and penny-perfect reconciliation for teams managing $20M+ annual revenue.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Good fit for: high-stakes data migration, finance systems, operational reliability.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block bg-slate-50/80">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="card">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">What these projects have in common</h2>
      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
        <ul class="proof-list text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>The business had a real operational problem, not a toy software idea.</li>
          <li>The software touched money, customers, documents, fulfillment, or daily work.</li>
          <li>The solution had to be understandable by the team after launch.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="proof-list text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>The work involved Rails, APIs, data integrity, workflow design, or Shopify.</li>
          <li>The right answer was practical scope, not a big-team rebuild.</li>
          <li>Success meant shipping production software people actually used.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6">
        <%= link_to "Talk through your project", start_project_path, class: "btn-primary" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
